{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3442980/extras/gameplay_demo.gif?t=1745082131\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>A storm is coming, but umbrellas won\u2019t help \u2013 it\u2019s going to rain SAWBLADES!!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dodge, jump and somersault over razor-sharp sawblades in an attempt to survive the deadly storm! Compete in the global leaderboard for the spot of the best blade-jumper. Unlock quirky and outlandish characters to join in the blade jumping mayhem!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3442980/extras/customization.png?t=1745082131\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlock several dozen characters, sawblades and backgrounds. Customize the visuals to your liking - play as a dinosaur avoiding meteorites, or as a ninja dodging ninja stars! Go wild!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3442980/extras/characters-optimize.gif?t=1745082131\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3442980/extras/game_modes.png?t=1745082131\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Classic Mode</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Jump over sawblades to score points. Do it fast to regain time and delay the inevitable Sudden Death!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Phantom Mode</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The player character is invisible in this mode! Rely on your superior spatial reasoning skills to survive in this unforgiving mode!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Barrage Mode</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Once spawned, every sawblade stays in the room forever. This mode is the very definition of the word &quot;Overwhelming&quot;!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3442980/extras/barrage_demo.gif?t=1745082131\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3442980/extras/features.png?t=1745082131\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Skill-based score-chasing action</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">High-speed arcade gameplay with time pressure</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Juicy 8-bit style music</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlockable characters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlockable game modes</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A Slight Chance of Sawblades is a labor of love from a mostly solo game developer.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3442980?t=1745082131","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3442980/f4080400d236daf59b71f7adebc039223decebd9/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1745082131","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3442980/dd110b6800b97e0db12033b50e1909261cd8b84d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745082131","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3442980/dd110b6800b97e0db12033b50e1909261cd8b84d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745082131","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragra