 is the very definition of the word &quot;Overwhelming&quot;!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3442980/extras/barrage_demo.gif?t=1745082131\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3442980/extras/features.png?t=1745082131\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Skill-based score-chasing action</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">High-speed arcade gameplay with time pressure</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Juicy 8-bit style music</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlockable characters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlockable game modes</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A Slight Chance of Sawblades is a labor of love from a mostly solo game developer.</p>","developers":["Chinykian Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3442980/a6c0f719e52b8d3b5160a3611d7b9cba30dfcdc3/header.jpg?t=1745082131","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu 16<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 1 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Something that supports OpenGL 3.0+<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 70 MB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> 64bit-only</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257112444,"mp4":{"480":"http://